{"status":"answered","model_status":"answered","answer":"在马来西亚校区，请尽快向残障服务处（Disability Services）注册。注册后，DSS顾问会通过电子邮件、电话或Zoom与您联系，讨论您需要的学习调整。","points":[{"text":"注册时需提交由独立合格健康专业人员出具的材料，说明您的病情、对学业的影响及建议的支持措施。","source_id":"my-disability-register#1","quote":"clearly state the condition, its impacts on your academic life, and recommendations for accommodations to address these impacts.","doc":"my-disability-register","title":"Register with Disability Services","section":"Register with Disability Services","level":null,"campus":"my","topic":"disability","url":"https://www.monash.edu.my/student-services/support-services/disability-support/register-with-disability-services","verified":true,"reason":null},{"text":"请尽早注册，因为评估过程可能需要一些时间。","source_id":"all-disability-alternative-assessment#2","quote":"The assessment process can take some time, so it’s a good idea to register as early as possible.","doc":"all-disability-alternative-assessment","title":"Alternative assessment arrangements","section":"Eligibility","level":null,"campus":"all","topic":"disability","url":"https://www.monash.edu/students/admin/assessments/alternative","verified":true,"reason":null},{"text":"注册信息是保密的，未经您同意不会被披露或分享。","source_id":"my-disability-register#3","quote":"Any sensitive information you disclose is kept securely within Disability Services.","doc":"my-disability-register","title":"Register with Disability Services","section":"Register with Disability Services","level":null,"campus":"my","topic":"disability","url":"https://www.monash.edu.my/student-services/support-services/disability-support/register-with-disability-services","verified":true,"reason":null}],"citations":[{"source_id":"my-disability-register#1","quote":"The Disability Services takes into consideration the impact of your disability in the academic environment. If you require additional support and advice, it is vital that you register with the Disability Services as soon as possible.","doc":"my-disability-register","title":"Register w